---
source: crates/pgt-ddl/src/build/matview.rs
expression: render(&p)
---
[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public.mv RENAME TO "select"
[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW public."select" SET SCHEMA "App"
[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW "App"."select" SET TABLESPACE fast  -- Veri yeniden yazılır; ACCESS EXCLUSIVE kilidi alır
[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW "App"."select" SET (fillfactor = 50)
[Safe] COMMENT ON MATERIALIZED VIEW "App"."select" IS NULL
[Destructive] REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW "App"."select"  -- ACCESS EXCLUSIVE kilit: yenileme süresince okunamaz
[Safe] ALTER MATERIALIZED VIEW "App"."select" OWNER TO b
